# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 4 (a plain function applied to an event and a dynamic is lifted over the event and reads the dynamic at each firing) and Semantics ch. 3 (a hold read in the tick of its write has its value from before).
test asked_told_asked

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="ask")
    1: Ui.Button(label="tell")
    2: Ui.Label(text="nothing")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="untold")

tick 2
  in:
    1: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="telling")

tick 3
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="told ada")
